        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PNFAdHvi9oiLwKxPM5ilaA4Ygtc\"><em><strong>The graph below gives information on the numbers of participants for different activities at one social center in Melbourne, Australia for the period 2000 to 2020.</strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ISgido1UKosBAjxdYjPlgB4QgUe\"><em><strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. </strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Social Center Activities in Melbourne: 2000&ndash;2020</em></div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\"><em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\">Xem livestream giải c&aacute;c đề c&ugrave;ng thầy Phạm Minh Khoa <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">(<strong>2 lần 9.0</strong>)</span></span></em></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/bai-viet/ielts-writing-task-1/tong-hop-record-livestream-va-bai-mau-ielts-writing-cua-anh-pham-minh-khoa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tại đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute;!</a></span></em></span>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EsbPdSwXhooyBzxrCzYlSuXRgNK\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/170/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570?collection=lesson&amp;item=25\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6TFdwHfPoeXxlxBjkklw7Q4g4c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Social Center Activities in Melbourne: 2000&ndash;2020 y&ecirc;u cầu ch&uacute;ng ta m&ocirc; tả th&ocirc;ng tin về 5 hoạt động v&agrave; số lượng người tham gia tại một trung t&acirc;m x&atilde; hội ở Melbourne, Australia trong giai đoạn từ 2000 đến 2020.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SADfdYmdKogDtAxHgQjlQ54Dg2b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P60IddVMeolilpx8ZhxlqYmngyc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Social Center Activities in Melbourne: 2000&ndash;2020 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: 5 hoạt động - số lượng người tham gia - một trung t&acirc;m x&atilde; hội ở Melbourne, Australia - từ 2000 đến 2020</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FGt8d54Wdo5AvGxhCDAlL93cgSe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/124/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570-internal?collection=lesson&amp;item=26\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3jsdfBwmoO7UGxbsTwlFXiYgle\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GH1wdglVIoueRrxskN2lUaRhg0f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DxLBdrwbioE8duxcnGZlhrqNgnf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>Amateur dramatics giảm, table tennis + musical performances tăng, film club v&agrave; martial arts th&igrave; tương đối ổn định.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DeDmdB2CgogawVxXf2NlbLMQgHb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Film club l&uacute;c n&agrave;o cũng thu h&uacute;t được nhiều người tham nhất.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C5XFd70iEoOevixhSqHlYUXNg5b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IOX6d3mubow8NIxjcQHlwcnDgg3\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IOX6d3mubow8NIxjcQHlwcnDgg3\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OEAAd1S3roly4Xxx5ctlxtN5gme\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Hoạt động c&oacute; sự thay đổi (amateur dramatics, table tennis v&agrave; musical performances)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TgBfdY2bSolNeNxPVOwl81MsgAg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EcLGdCH83o1NIExeR9zlwu9ag4g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2000 </strong><em>(26 người tham gia amateur dramatics, </em><em><strong>hơn</strong></em><em> table tennis 8 người v&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng ai tham gia musical performances).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EFJzdB3ejorIwqxLfjQlLOODgi9\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của amateur dramatics </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng đạt đỉnh</strong></em><em> đến 30 người tham gia, sau đ&oacute; giảm xuống c&ograve;n 10 người v&agrave;o năm 2020).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MjuWdnjWioGKrAxywSrlaDuBgMc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của table tennis </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng nhẹ</strong></em><em> l&ecirc;n 20 người năm 2010, sau đ&oacute; </em><em><strong>tăng đạt đỉnh</strong></em><em> đến 55 người v&agrave;o năm 2020).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J3gMdLHpUospERxCnrwlgyw9gwf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của musical performances </strong><em>(sau 2005 </em><em><strong>tăng từ từ</strong></em><em> đến khi c&oacute; 20 người tham gia v&agrave;o năm 2020).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TB9jdFQPKopPbaxyiZHlhHNJggf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> Hoạt động kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; sự thay đổi (film club v&agrave; martial arts)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IikBde1xeoZUlPxMlN0lhq0Rgse\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ORbfdynYToHIppx3i9PlJKe4g9a\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của martial arts </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>ổn định</strong></em><em> v&agrave; </em><em><strong>dao động</strong></em><em> ở con số 35 người tham gia trong suốt thời kỳ)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KyVbdliRDoszyBx7cPTlQFmqgYd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của film club </strong><em>(vẫn</em><em><strong> duy tr&igrave; </strong></em><em>sự phổ biến ở con số 65 người tham gia, với một thay đổi nhỏ sau 2 thập kỷ).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuxRdF0GuoF09YxnotEl2yn7gbj\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpCLdjfhXoMPCsxkxDwlynJYgAQ\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G0c3dGZoNomf7CxYvAslCF1Ugaf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-II7AdttkQoWLJdxsH4Zl52hsg1f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rdifdw5WuoZgMAxvDuCl4fOVgBd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt <strong>\"số lượng người tham gia\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"the number of participants\" </strong>hay<strong> participant numbers</strong> th&igrave; m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể linh hoạt d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"attendance numbers\" </strong>hay<strong> \"membership\" </strong>để b&agrave;i viết của m&igrave;nh c&oacute; sự đa dạng về mặt c&acirc;u từ nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGEQdtvqtofVMvxf7FBl10zhgVc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BnWDdTZEzogMiOxOxoHl2gLjgsg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Attendance numbers</strong> for the film club and martial arts exhibited relative stability over the 20 years.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RmL2dYzYWogziwxHRTzlU45igRg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">The amateur dramatics group saw a marked reduction in <strong>membership</strong> and, after having 25 to 28 members in the first five years.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
